intaining guardrails.\n\n    *   Does it meet Art 12(1)? Yes (automatic recording).\n    *   Does it meet Art 12(2)? Yes, the event-bus approach is designed for traceability and monitoring.\n    *   Does it meet Art 12(3)? Yes, specifically targets those data points.\n\n    *   Rationale: Centralizing record-keeping through a standardized middleware service minimizes the risk of inconsistent or omitted logs across various projects, ensuring strict adherence to Article 12 while preserving R&D velocity. This systematic approach is far superior to relying on per-project implementation for critical regulatory requirements.\n    *   Decision: Approve.\n    *   Promise: Very high (95). It's a textbook solution for institutional compliance in a multi-project environment.",
