ation:* It's a technical implementation (SDK/Middleware) targeting existing tools (MLflow/Kubeflow), making it an efficient way to scale compliance across multiple projects rather than handling it ad-hoc per project.\n\n    *   Does it meet Article 12(1)? Yes (automatic recording).\n    *   Does it meet Article 12(2)? Yes (traceability for risk/monitoring).\n    *   Does it meet Article 12(3)? Yes (timestamps, reference DBs, inputs).",
